BT /F1 11 Tf 72 470 Td (leave the warehouse by the first van of the morning.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 456 Td (Pens are sold in boxes of twelve and paper by the ream,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 442 Td (tape and glue by the single roll or the single tube.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 428 Td (A box that arrives damaged is replaced without charge) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 414 Td (if the carrier is told within three working days.) Tj ET
